ackgrounds, and valuing the social and creative aspects of cooking. The user explicitly contrasts this with a passive cooking show they found unengaging.\",\"variable\":\"past_interests\",\"revoked\":[],\"semantic_status\":\"model_judgment\",\"value_ref\":\"t0\"},{\"id\":\"fact_f8d2bf8728cb4bb0677115fe\",\"stance\":\"support\",\"source_ids\":[\"s29\",\"s30\"],\"entity_scope\":\"user\",\"time_scope\":\"past\",\"parent_versions\":{},\"retract_ids\":[],\"reason\":\"The user explicitly stated they found a cooking show unengaging and much prefer hands-on experiences, citing the inability to replicate the tactile joy and personal experimentation of cooking oneself.\",\"variable\":\"dislikes\",\"revoked\":[],\"semantic_status\":\"model_judgment\",\"value_ref\":\"t1\"},{\"id\":\"fact_fb2d52ea1adc9fbed7ebf081\",\"stance\":\"support\",\"source_ids\":[\"s39\",\"s21\",\"s48\",\"s29\",\"s19\",\"s40\",\"s20\",\"s4\",\"s12\",\"s47\",\"s3\",\"s30\",\"s11\"],\"entity_scope\":\"user\",\"time_scope\":\"present\",\"parent_versions\":{},\"retract_ids\":[],\"reason\":\"The user's statements across multiple conversations consistently describe enjoyment of hands-on cooking, exploration of various cuisines, and participation in classes/workshops. No mention of dietary restrictions, allergies, or equipment constraints was found. The user explicitly states a preference for hands-on experiences over passive shows (s29-s30).\",\"variable\":\"constraints\",\"revoked\":[],\"semantic_status\":\"model_judgment\",\"value_ref\":\"t2\"},{\"id\":\"fact_511afa7bfd6158f36f2142c0\",\"stance\":\"support\",\"source_ids\":[\"s39\",\"s21\",\"s29\",\"s19\",\"s40\",\"s20\",\"s4\",\"s3\",\"s30\"],\"entity_scope\":\"user\",\"time_scope\":\"recent_past\",\"parent_versions\":{},\"retract_ids\":[],\"reason\":\"The user explicitly states taking a cooking class (s3, s4), joining a couples cooking workshop (s39, s40), making a traditional dish (s19, s20, s21), and watching a cooking show they found unengaging (s29, s30). These are all recent hands-on culinary experiences with positive reactions to the hands-on ones and a negative reaction to the passive show.\",\"variable\":\"recent_experiments\",\"revoked\":[],\"semantic_status\":\"model_judgment\",\"value_ref\":\"t3\"},{\"id\":\"fact_b270d7f5e4ed67987bacf6a6\",\"stance\":\"support\",\"value\":\"Since you've recently taken a cooking class and enjoyed learning about both the techniques and cultural histories behind recipes, you might appreciate delving into fusion cuisines. Exploring how different cultures use similar ingredients in unique ways could further expand your culinary skills. Have you tried looking into how you can combine elements from the cuisines you learned about with others to create something entirely new?\",\"source_ids\":[\"s39\",\"s21\",\"s48\",\"s29\",\"s19\",\"s40\",\"s20\",\"s4\",\"s12\",\"s47\",\"s3\",\"s30\",\"s11\"],\"entity_scope\":\"user\",\"time_scope\":\"present\",\"parent_versions\":{\"past_interests\":1,\"dislikes\":1,\"constraints\":1,\"recent_experiments\":1},\"retract_ids\":[],\"reason\":\"The user's history shows a strong interest in hands-on cooking, exploring diverse cuisines and their cultural backgrounds, and a dislike for passive cooking shows. They have recently taken a cooking class and a couples workshop, and made a traditional dish. Fusion cuisines directly build on this by combining elements from different culinary traditions, allowing the user to continue hands-on experimentation and cultural exploration. This option aligns with the user's preference for active, creative cooking and their interest in the cultural stories behind food, without suggesting passive activities or overly technical approaches that might not match their stated enjoyment of accessible, communal cooking.\",\"variable\":\"response\",\"revoked\":[],\"semantic_status\":\"model_judgment\"}],\"source_spans\":[[\"s3\",\"d1\",105,392,\"User: I even took a cooking class recently to learn new techniques and recipes, which was really enlightening! It was fascinating to explore not just the recipes but also the cultural background behind them, as many dishes come with rich histories that deepen our appreciation for food. \",\"user\",[95]],[\"s4\",\"d1\",392,791,\"The hands-on experience of preparing different cuisines has really expanded my palate and made me consider how flavors interact in cooking. I also got to meet some amazing fellow food enthusiasts who shared their own stories and tips during the class, creating a vibrant community focused on culinary arts. Overall, it was much more than a class; it felt like a journey into the heart of gastronomy.\",\"user\",[95]],[\"s11\",\"d2\",105,432,\"User: I've been exploring my passion for food lately, especially cooking. Cooking has become a delightful escape for me, a means of expressing my creativity and bringing joy to others. The process of selecting fresh ingredients, experimenting with different flavors, and presenting a dish beautifully is incredibly fulfilling. \",\"user\",[93]],[\"s12\",\"d2\",432,769,\"I often find myself lost in the nuances of taste and texture, and it's rewarding to see how a simple meal can evoke such happiness in those who share it with me. Lately, I've been trying to perfect my skills in making different cuisines, from Italian to Thai, and it has opened up a whole new world of culinary traditions and techniques.\",\"user\",[93]],[\"s19\",\"d3\",107,464,\"User: I really enjoy experimenting with different cuisines, and I recently made a traditional dish from another culture, which was quite an intriguing experience. The colorful ingredients and the rich history behind each recipe often inspire me to learn more about the culture itself, broadening my culinary horizons and appreciation for global traditions. \",\"user\",[111]],[\"s20\",\"d3\",464,817,\"It's fascinating to think about how food serves as a bridge between people, fostering connections and understanding through shared meals and flavors. I ofte